films. It took less than 2 hours to film. All the footage was lost except for a VHS tape with this edit with its enduring timecode. The version of Summer Babe was from an unmastered cassette. The club kid outift was borrowed from Love Saves the Day. \n \nIt was filmed on a pier in Greenpoint and in Central Park.  \n \nSpiral and Gary were in Stockton which is why it was put on the shelf until now.\" -  Director, Tanya Small\n\nPavement: \nhttps://www.instagram.com/pavementband/\nhttps://twitter.com/pavement_band\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@pavementofficial\nhttps://www.facebook.com/pavementtherockb\nhttps://pavementband.com/\n\nMatador Records:\nhttp://www.matadorrecords.com/\nhttps://www.instagram.com/matadorrecords\nhttps://twitter.com/matadorrecords\nhttps://www.facebook.com/MatadorRecords/\n\n#Pavement", "channel_id": "UCVjleeSDIuZ7WjeProi91Bg", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCVjleeSDIuZ7WjeProi91Bg", "duration": 202, "view_count": 171572, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c9Ks0kvlxXw", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": ["pavement", "pavement band", "pavement live", "interview", "stereo", "brighten the corners", "chasing pavements", "cut your hair", "gold soundz", "slanted and enchanted", "range life", "shady lane", "harness your hopes", "crooked rain", "spit on a stranger", "father to a sister of thought", "greatest hits", "carrot rope", "wowee zowee", "terror twilight", "pavement major leagues", "pavement major leagues live", "major leagues lyrics", "Matador Records", "stephen malkmus", "spiral stairs", "rock", "indie", "indie rock", "alternative"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "comment_count": 213, "heatmap": [{"start_time": 0.0, "end_time": 2.02, "value": 1.0}, {"start_time": 2.02, "end_time": 4.04, "value": 